<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Merchant nine-month net down.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Merchant nine-month net down.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Merchant Bank of Sri Lanka Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			   9 months 1996	    9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		 810.07     vs	    621.58</p>
<p>    Net profit		24.90     vs	     72.64</p>
<p>    Tax provision	   11.63     vs		9.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchant Bank is a subsidiary of the state-owned Bank of Ceylon.</p>
<p>-- Colombo (941) 434319</p>
</text>
